.<E>\n<AUDCAP>Gentle, music-box-like piano notes, the soft crackle of a storybook fireplace, a light breeze rustling leaves, the girl's tender voice wrapped in a warm, intimate acoustic space.<ENDAUDCAP>\n\n一束柔和的聚光灯照亮了一位二十岁女孩的特写。一阵微风吹拂着她的金发，几缕发丝飘过她精致的脸庞。她的肌肤光滑白皙，双颊泛着淡淡的红晕。她慢慢抬起头，嗓音清甜地说道：<S>你喜欢我吗？<E> 接着，她抬眸望向远方，眼中闪烁着温柔的期待，轻声呢喃：<S>期待在未来与你相遇。<E>\n\n<AUDCAP>轻柔如八音盒般的钢琴音符，故事书壁炉的柔和噼啪声，微风拂过树叶的沙沙响动，女孩温柔的嗓音包裹在温暖亲密的声学空间里。<ENDAUDCAP>\n\n\n第二段\nA young girl, close-up shot. A gentle breeze blows, revealing her long, flowing golden hair. The hair looks soft and slightly ruffled by the wind, framing her delicate face. Her skin is fair and smooth, with a faint blush on her cheeks. She tossed her head back and proclaimed in a clear, sweet voice: <S>Do you like me?<E> Then, she looks up into the distance, her eyes shining with a tender light: <S>I look forward to meeting you in the future.<E>\n<AUDCAP>Ethereal and faint background humming, the subtle fluttering sounds of magical creatures, the gurgling of a stream, and the girl's gentle words with an echo.<ENDAUDCAP>\n\n一名年轻女孩，近距离特写。轻风拂过，扬起她流光溢彩的金色长发，发丝柔软微乱，勾勒出精致的脸庞。肌肤白皙细腻，双颊泛着淡淡红晕。她微微仰首，用甜美的嗓音说道：<S>你喜欢我吗？<E> 随后抬眼望向远方，眼眸中流转着温柔光芒：<S>期待未来与你相遇。<E>\n<AUDCAP>缥缈的背景哼鸣，精灵翅翼掠过的细微震颤，远方溪流的潺潺絮语，少女柔声倾诉带着朦胧的回响。<ENDAUDCAP>\n\n第三段 \nA young girl, close-up shot. A gentle breeze blows, revealing her long, flowing golden hair. The hair looks soft and slightly ruffled by the wind, framing her delicate face. Her skin is fair and smooth, with a faint blush on her cheeks. She slowly tilts her head back slightly and murmurs in a sweet voice: <S>Do you like me?<E> Then, she looks up into the distance, her eyes shining with a tender light: <S>I look forward to meeting you in the future.<E>\n<AUDCAP>A visceral, guttural roar. The shattering of glass and twisting of metal. Aggressive, distorted electric guitar feedback and pounding, chaotic industrial drums that build to an explosive peak, suppressed sobbing.<ENDAUDCAP>\n\n\n一位年轻女孩，特写镜头。微风轻拂，显露出她流光溢彩的金色长发。发丝在风中轻柔飘动，勾勒出她精致的脸庞。肌肤白皙柔滑，双颊泛着淡淡红晕。她微微后仰脸庞，用甜美的嗓音低语：<S>你喜欢我吗？<E> 随后抬眼望向远方，眸中流转着温柔光芒：<S>期待在未来与你相遇。<E>\n\n<AUDCAP>发自脏腑的低沉咆哮，玻璃迸裂与金属扭曲的尖锐嘶鸣。狂暴失真的电吉他回授与轰鸣的工业鼓点交织攀升至爆发顶点，其间压抑着破碎的呜咽。<ENDAUDCAP>\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":26,"type":"Note","pos":[10923.833857918033,9629.523519353444],"size":[398.9917724374245,226.6121735905508],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"CNB使用OVI工作流 必看！！！","properties":{},"widgets_values":["CNB平台 一点通仓库中并没有直接上传OVI模型\n\n如果想要使用这个工作流，请打开后台，点击右下角小+号打开新的bash终端\n\n复制以下命令到bash终端中并且回车\n\naria2c -c -x 16 -s 16 \\\n\"https://cnb.cool/ai-models/chetwinlow1/Ovi/-/lfs/2fc69b734ffb68081240b957ecfc10cf63c1a80fbf38492f60d8e4aad8440cc4?name=model.safetensors\" \\\n-o \"Ovi-11B-bf16.safetensors\" \\\n-d \"/workspace/models/diffusion_models\"\n\n这是从CNB官方的模型仓库下载，走腾讯内网速度起飞，22G模型几十秒就能下完\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[5,3,0,5,0,"OVI_ENGINE"],[6,5,0,14,1,"OVI_VIDEO_LATENTS"],[7,5,1,14,2,"OVI_AUDIO_LATENTS"],[8,5,2,14,0,"OVI_ENGINE"],[9,14,0,1,0,"IMAGE"],[10,14,1,1,1,"AUDIO"],[12,15,0,16,0,"OVI_ENGINE"],[13,16,0,3,0,"OVI_ENGINE"],[20,4,0,5,1,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":1.0610764609500025,"offset":[-10749.470358657973,-9522.23546448692]},"frontendVersion":"1.28.6","ue_links":[],"links_added_by_ue":[],"VHS_latentpreview":false,"VHS_latentpreviewrate":0,"VHS_MetadataImage":true,"VHS_KeepIntermediate":true},"version":0.4}